    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors Last Stand is a rogue-like action shoot 'em up game. Kill aliens to upgrade your weapons. Harvest gems to unlock permanent upgrades and new characters to play or just reroll a new hand of cards to choose from. Create wild combinations of weapons and abilities for crazy builds with each playthrough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Playable Characters</p>",
